#
# Single violation: a math:NormalizationDeclaration that correctly names its (source,
# target) pair AND carries exactly one math:normalizationStrength — so the unqualified
# min/max-cardinality-1 restriction pair is fully satisfied — but points that strength at
# an IRI outside the four closed math:NormalizationStrength rungs.
#
# This is the WHICH-FOUR half of math:UndeclaredNormalizationStrength, which the count half
# cannot see: counting reaches exactly one value and stops. It is decided by
# math:NormalizationStrengthValueConstraint, whose logic:termIn formula tests IRI
# MEMBERSHIP rather than the value's asserted type — so it decides identically here, where
# ex:handWavyNormalization is typed as nothing at all, and in the shipped bundle, where the
# four real rungs are typed. A value-set worded as a class constraint would instead have
# asked what ex:handWavyNormalization is typed AS, found nothing, and rejected correct
# consumer data for the same reason it rejected this slice's own reference example.
#
# Isolation: the declaration is held at a strength that is not math:structuralNormalization,
# so math:UnattributedNormalizationConstraint's coarser-than-structural guard WOULD engage —
# hence the full attribution coat below (procedure, holding observation with its vantage, and
# preservation kind), so the only finding is the off-ladder strength itself.
@prefix math:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:sumXY math:normalForm ex:sumYX .

ex:offLadderDecl a math:NormalizationDeclaration ;
    math:normalizes ex:sumXY ;
    math:normalizesTo ex:sumYX ;
    math:normalizationStrength ex:handWavyNormalization ;
    math:normalizationProcedure ex:handWavyRewrite ;
    logic:preservationKind logic:preservesSatisfiability .

ex:handWavyRewrite a math:NormalizationProcedure .

ex:offLadderObservation a gmeow:Observation ;
    gmeow:observationResult ex:offLadderDecl ;
    gmeow:observedFeature ex:sumXY ;
    gmeow:vantage ex:rewriterStandpoint .

ex:rewriterStandpoint a gmeow:Standpoint , gmeow:Entity .
